* The integrals of a nonnegative continuous function over the intervals of length D centred at D-separated points of [ 0 , 1 - D ] sum to at most its integral over ( -u ( D / 2 ) , -u ( D / 2 ) + 1 ) (LargeSieve points_large_sieve, hdisj).

